    <string name="wiz_done_title">You\'re set</string>
    <string name="wiz_done_body">EverShelf can now use «Fuel mode / At my pace» with your activity. The bridge syncs in the background and keeps every unsent day queued.</string>
    <string name="wiz_done_battery">Next, Android may ask to keep this app unrestricted (no battery optimization) so the background sync is not killed.</string>
    <string name="wiz_step_count">Step %1$d of %2$d</string>
